From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:48:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: STEINS;GATE 0 system message box

Instruction 00:43 and its draw translated from Game.exe (the box over the
system menu, save and load screens: exit / title / load confirmations); a
surface the engine loads itself (DATA01) resolves to its profile sheet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

